  "description": "A renowned Australian University College and global pioneer in creative media and technology, SAE provides specialist higher education courses worldwide to inspire and develop our graduates. Located in Adelaide Brisbane, Byron Bay, Melbourne, Perth, and Sydney – our Australian student body consists of over 2,500 creatives who excel in programs across nine disciplines – Animation, Audio, Computer Science, Creative Industries, Design, Film, Games, Music, VFX & Virtual Production. We’re passionate about our students’ potential and encourage them to chase their dreams. We promise that your SAE experience – wherever you are enrolled in the world – will offer a progressive learning experience to meet your creative, technological and professional aspirations, help you stand out from the crowd, and give you a ticket to the global stage.",
